<title>USA: MotorVac Q4 shr loss narrows to $0.08.</title>
<headline>MotorVac Q4 shr loss narrows to $0.08.</headline>
<text>
<p>SANTA ANA, Calif., March 14 (Reute) -</p>
<p>				1996	  Q4	    1995</p>
<p> Shr	 loss	   $0.08    loss	  $0.19</p>
<p> Net	 loss	     345    loss	    847</p>
<p> Revs			 2,421		    1,499</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,515			n/a</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is MotorVac Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>Q4 1996 includes litigations expenses of $262,000.</p>
<p>Q4 1996 figures are on a pro forma basis.</p>
<p>The company completed an initial public offering of stock in April 1996.</p>
